.temp/resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_results.md:18:- Applied `allowedConsecutiveMisses` to automatic keepalive failures before connection-fatal teardown. Preserved the active connect phase before teardown and populated timeout/cancellation counters plus pending-open/read/write and queued-byte gauges.
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-1ozsb6/TASK-260715-1ozsb6_results.md:19:- Added an ephemeral macOS loopback OpenSSH fixture with an in-memory P-256 external signer. It proves host-policy-before-credential ordering, public-key authentication, direct-tcpip echo, concurrent exec opens, exec/stdin upload, server-rekey traffic survival, manual client rekey, keepalive transmission, five connected read/cancel races, and three successful connect/close resource baselines.
